              "text": "The most famous version of the Christmas song **\"All I Want for Christmas Is You\"** is sung by **Mariah Carey**. She co-wrote and released the uptempo pop hit in **1994** for her holiday album, *Merry Christmas*. It has since become one of the best-selling and most popular Christmas songs of all time.\n\nHowever, there is another well-known country-pop Christmas song with the exact same title:\n* **Vince Vance & the Valiants** released their own, completely different song called **\"All I Want for Christmas Is You\"** in **1989**. It features lead vocals by Lisa Layne and is also a frequent holiday favorite, particularly on country radio.",
